  nonce: c7e6  # c7e6
  message: "Materialized from dogfood tranche 05 (F88.A1 / anon-card-009). Mechanism: call-specific Edge.create DEFAULT evidence_type='ast_call_direct' leaks onto non-call edges. Evidence: frozen substrate + source — ir.py:650 / ir.py:610 default; solidity.py:395-404 emits inherits via Edge.create() with no evidence_type kwarg. Magnitude: 326 non-call edges stamped ast_call_direct (dispatches_to 293, references 31, inherits 1, overrides 1) + intra-edge-type axis inconsistency on dispatches_to (293 ast_call_direct vs 326 type_hierarchy). Fresh repro: hypergumbo run on the tracker package reproduces websocket-linker references edges carrying call-evidence. Blind severity 4/5, reproduced (grounded at source, not injection). RELATED_BUT_DISTINCT from WI-molit (resolution-state smuggling ast_call vs ast_call_direct), WI-guvup (evidence_type vocabulary-drift count 33 vs 9), INV-dovus (evidence_type fragmentation for imports), and parent META INV-numat (edge vocab fields mix axes). New mechanism = the call-specific Edge.create DEFAULT bleeding onto non-call edges + intra-edge-type inconsistency."  # c7e6
